## 11. PR checklist for any change in this area

A change that touches **any** of the following requires explicit confirmation against this policy:

- [ ] Files under `pc2-node/crates/ddrm-decrypt/`
- [ ] `pc2-node/src/services/wasm/WasmDdrmDecryptRuntime.ts`
- [ ] `pc2-node/src/services/session/BackendSessionService.ts`
- [ ] `pc2-node/src/api/chipotle-client.ts`
- [ ] `pc2-node/src/api/middleware/secureViewSession.ts`
- [ ] `pc2-node/src/api/storage.ts` (any function in the `/lit/*` or `decryptAssetTwoLayer` / `renderViaWASM` / `recoverWithSession` path)
- [ ] `pc2-node/src/api/media.ts` (any function in the `/media/*` or `recoverMediaCEK` / `decryptSegmentViaWASM` path)
- [ ] `pc2-node/src/services/media/sessionManager.ts`
- [ ] `pc2-node/wasm-renderer/src/lib.rs` (the renderer's mode dispatcher)
- [ ] `pc2-node/data/lit-actions/universal-decrypt-chipotle.js`
- [ ] `pc2-node/src/wallet-bridge/pc2-secure-view.js`
- [ ] `pc2-node/src/wallet-bridge/pc2-wallet-bridge.js`
- [ ] `pc2-node/data/test-apps/{ddrm-viewer,pc2-media-runtime}/`
- [ ] `pc2-node/scripts/build-wasm.sh`

For each touched file, verify against rules 1–9 above. When in doubt, escalate via task plan (`.cursor/tasks/<TASK-ID>/`) rather than committing.

