## 12. Reading order for AI agents new to this area

1. [`docs/core/DDRM_DECRYPT_RUNTIME.md`](../../docs/core/DDRM_DECRYPT_RUNTIME.md) §1–4 (mental model + flows).
2. This security rules file in full.
3. `pc2-node/src/api/chipotle-client.ts` lines around `ISessionView`, `ICencDecryptor`, `BackendSessionView`, `WasmSessionView`.
4. `pc2-node/crates/ddrm-decrypt/src/lib.rs` (the C ABI surface — note the absence of `get_cek`).
5. `pc2-node/data/lit-actions/universal-decrypt-chipotle.js` (the TEE verifier).

Only after reading all five should you propose changes that touch the files in the PR checklist above.
